4106 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4107 0 R/Alt(Pilot Study 2: participants were assigned to expected incriminating evidence or unexpected incriminating evidence and retained that outcome type for all three scenarios. They read self-managed abortion, non-criminal miscarriage, and criminal miscarriage affidavits in one of six orders. Within each scenario, they read the affidavit, gave pre-outcome judgments, received their assigned outcome, and gave post-outcome judgments. The three search targets were rated before the first outcome only. Attitudes and demographics followed all three scenarios.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[3]/Pg 48241 0 R>>
endobj
