<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 22981 0 R/Alt(Path diagram in black and white. Expected evidence and unexpected evidence, on the left and each against no information, point to evidence relevance (the ten-item mean), which points to pregnancy-evidence likelihood, which points to the probable-cause ruling (probit) on the right. Each path carries its unstandardized estimate, the four context-specific paths one value per legal context, tagged Abortion and Disposal; no star or line style is coded, the intervals being in the tables.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 48491 0 R>>
